{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barda mixes elements from deckbuilder roguelikes and backpack management games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/922852a81c6536708353d2a3e3973839.poster.avif?t=1773075387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/922852a81c6536708353d2a3e3973839.webm?t=1773075387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/922852a81c6536708353d2a3e3973839.mp4?t=1773075387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply drag and drop the best object you have on a challenge to complete it and move on to the next zone. If you don't have anything suitable, you can always use your own two hands and a dash of courage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/a73345ab8549203e0fd88f706ff8d4c9.poster.avif?t=1773075387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/a73345ab8549203e0fd88f706ff8d4c9.webm?t=1773075387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/a73345ab8549203e0fd88f706ff8d4c9.mp4?t=1773075387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Barda, your goal is to climb as high as possible up an unforgiving, randomised mountain. You will need to use and sort through dozens of items that you loot from many different biomes and zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/d70edb0b2f1ee1e89dfc702f9b2b0d3d.poster.avif?t=1773075387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/d70edb0b2f1ee1e89dfc702f9b2b0d3d.webm?t=1773075387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/d70edb0b2f1ee1e89dfc702f9b2b0d3d.mp4?t=1773075387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our innovative inventory system, every problem directly affects your backpack. Hunger, fatigue, madness. These are just some of the things that can happen during a run. How can you keep your bag tidy in those conditions?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/a74df623b20502dcc958b062b69dc90f.poster.avif?t=1773075387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/a74df623b20502dcc958b062b69dc90f.webm?t=1773075387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/a74df623b20502dcc958b062b69dc90f.mp4?t=1773075387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions to unlock options in the Explorer's Tree and keep trying to reach the summit of the Mountain until you manage to scatter your deceased grandfather's ashes there.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664320?t=1773075387","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664320?t=1773075387","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/59f147b33e350d81ae414df68f914b92e1a20534/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773075387","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/59f147b33e350d81ae414df68f914b92e1a20534/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773075387","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3723520,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barda mixes elements from deckbuilder roguelikes and backpack management games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/922852a81c6536708353d2a3e3973839.poster.avif?t=1773075387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/922852a81c6536708353d2a3e3973839.webm?t=1773075387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/922852a81c6536708353d2a3e3973839.mp4?t=1773075387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply drag and drop the best object you have on a challenge to complete it and move on to the next zone. If you don't have anything suitable, you can always use your own two hands and a dash of courage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/a73345ab8549203e0fd88f706ff8d4c9.poster.avif?t=1773075387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/a73345ab8549203e0fd88f706ff8d4c9.webm?t=1773075387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/a73345ab8549203e0fd88f706ff8d4c9.mp4?t=1773075387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Barda, your goal is to climb as high as possible up an unforgiving, randomised mountain. You will need to use and sort through dozens of items that you loot from many different biomes and zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/d70edb0b2f1ee1e89dfc702f9b2b0d3d.poster.avif?t=1773075387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/d70edb0b2f1ee1e89dfc702f9b2b0d3d.webm?t=1773075387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/d70edb0b2f1ee1e89dfc702f9b2b0d3d.mp4?t=1773075387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our innovative inventory system, every problem directly affects your backpack. Hunger, fatigue, madness. These are just some of the things that can happen during a run. How can you keep your bag tidy in those conditions?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/a74df623b20502dcc958b062b69dc90f.poster.avif?t=1773075387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/a74df623b20502dcc958b062b69dc90f.webm?t=1773075387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/a74df623b20502dcc958b062b69dc90f.mp4?t=1773075387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions to unlock options in the Explorer's Tree and keep trying to reach the summit of the Mountain until you manage to scatter your deceased grandfather's ashes there.</p>","developers":["Mudita Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/c167814486286145ca691aa1e86a59182ef36a8e/header.jpg?t=1773075387","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> \tBig Sur 11 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon, x64 architecture with SSE2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal capable Intel and AMD GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3664320/2043977541/273b42afbf64f7e236c47be17f292cfcbf83cdca/1769766056/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769782445","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3664320/2043977541/273b42afbf64f7e236c47be17f292cfcbf83cdca/1769766056/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769782445","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3664320/2043977541/273b42afbf64f7e236c47be17f292cfcbf83cdca/1769766056/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769782445","id":257275983,"name":"Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257275983/40f91d94276b0be862165cf4d75de61c39b514f0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769782445"}],"name":"Barda","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"BARDA - $8.99 USD","packageid":1290972,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_tex